          }
        }
      }
    },
    "デフォルトのアカウント": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Default Account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "新規メール作成時の差出人の既定を選べます。削除などで無効になった場合は先頭のアカウントに戻ります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose the default From account for new messages. If it becomes invalid (e.g. the account was deleted), this falls back to the first account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ブラウザ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Browser"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "リンクを開く方法": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Links In"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "削除/アーカイブ後の動作": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After Delete/Archive"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "メール本文画面から削除・アーカイブ・迷惑メールにする操作をしたあと、一覧に戻るか次のメールを自動で開くかを選べます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose whether to return to the list or automatically open the next message after deleting, archiving, or marking a message as junk from the message view."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "メール一覧に戻る": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Return to Mail List"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "次のメールを開く": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Next Message"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 機能 (翻訳・要約)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI Features (Translation & Summary)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 機能": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI Features"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "翻訳・要約は Apple Intelligence により端末内で行われ、外部に送信されません。オフにすると、メール本文画面の翻訳バー・AI要約ボタンの両方が表示されなくなります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Translation and summarization happen on-device via Apple Intelligence and are never sent anywhere else. Turning this off hides both the translation bar and the AI summary button in the message view."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "表示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Display"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "スワイプ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swipe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "統合受信トレイの未読数をアプリアイコンに表示します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows the unified inbox's unread count on the app icon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今すぐ終了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quit Now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あとで": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Later"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "表示言語を変更しました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Display Language Changed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "変更を反映するには、アプリを完全に終了してもう一度起動してください（ホーム画面に戻るだけでは反映されません）。「今すぐ終了」でアプリを終了できます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To apply the change, fully quit the app and reopen it (returning to the Home Screen alone isn't enough). You can quit the app now with “Quit Now.”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "送信キャンセル": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send Cancellation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "送信取り消しの猶予": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel-Send Grace Period"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「送信」をタップしてから実際にサーバーへ送るまでの猶予時間です。この間は「送信を取り消す」で送信をキャンセルできます。アプリをバックグラウンドに切り替えると、残り時間に関わらず即座に送信されます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The grace period between tapping “Send” and the message actually being sent to the server. You can cancel sending during this time with “Cancel Send.” Switching the app to the background sends the message immediately, regardless of the remaining time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "メールの表示 (HTML)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Message Display (HTML)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ONで一覧を会話単位にまとめます。OFFにすると一覧がメール単位になります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, the list groups messages into conversations. When off, the list shows one row per message."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "なし": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "None"
          }
        }
      }
    },
