    "最終接続: %@": {
      "comment": "Task #173 PushWatchStatusSection row subtitle for a registered watch, e.g. \"最終接続: 3分前\" / \"Last connected: 3 minutes ago\" — %@ is a relative-time-formatted Date.",
      "localizations": {
