            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in with Microsoft"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Microsoft のログイン画面が表示されます。会社・学校の Microsoft 365 アカウントでサインインしてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Microsoft's sign-in screen will appear. Sign in with your work or school Microsoft 365 account."
