          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Microsoft's sign-in screen will appear. Sign in with your personal Outlook.com / Hotmail account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Microsoft アカウントでの認証です。パスワードはこのアプリに保存されません。認証が切れた場合は「再認証」から再度サインインしてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This account authenticates with your Microsoft account. Your password is never stored in this app. If authentication expires, sign in again via “Reauthenticate.”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
