    },
    "直近の翻訳試行 (最大5件)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recent Translation Attempts (up to 5)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "実際にメールを翻訳しようとした際の記録です。件数・文字数・文字の種類の比率のみを表示し、メール本文そのものは表示しません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A record of actual mail-translation attempts. Shows only counts, character totals, and the ratio of character types — never the mail body itself."
